## Dataset

This project uses the Online Retail Dataset from Kaggle.

Source:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/carrie1/ecommerce-data

Dataset Details:
- 541,909 transactions
- December 2010 – December 2011
- UK-based online retailer
- 37 countries

Note: The dataset is not included in this repository due to licensing and file size considerations. Please download it directly from Kaggle.
